From af4b5a447f19eac7e98abfff19dfc8fce72fc706 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: downstream <downstream@local>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:42:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Centralize shared protocol schema and runtime configuration


Consolidated from the following original patches (file custody by final owner):

- original #18: Centralize existing portable collaboration type
- original #19: Use shared schema discriminators in Responses normalization
- original #42: Move file MIME types into shared configuration
- original #43: Centralize Gemini schema tables
- original #44: Centralize downstream protocol configuration
- original #45: Centralize inline native Gemini configuration
- original #46: Use shared translator protocol discriminators
- original #48: Centralize tool-choice and function-calling modes
- original #49: Reuse shared unspecified Gemini finish reason
- original #50: Preserve portable agent images and name alias limits
- original #51: Move Responses namespace alias limits into configuration
